I am inside the café now.
It is very warm here.
I take off my thick winter coat.
It is heavy.
I find a hook on the wall.
I hang my coat on the hook.
I also take off my scarf and my gloves.
The café is small and cozy.
I look for a good seat.
There is a small table by the window.
The table is next to a radiator.
I walk over to the table.
I sit down on the chair.
My hands are still cold.
I rub them together.
My hands get warmer.
It feels fantastic.
Now I am almost warm.
I am hungry and thirsty.
I would like to order something now.
